{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "the system\n  2 mod 4: x = 2\n    x = 2 (mod 4)\n  4 mod 6: x = 4\n    x = 4 (mod 6)\nx = 10 (mod 12)\n  how: the Chinese remainder theorem, pairwise (moduli that share factors must agree mod their gcd)\n  check: the solution substituted into every congruence: it holds; brute force over 0..11: 1 solution\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "crt", "ucas": "crt 2 mod 4, 4 mod 6", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "crt", "solutions": ["10"], "modulus": "12", "2_mod_4": "x = 2", "x": ["2 (mod 4)", "4 (mod 6)"], "4_mod_6": "x = 4", "method": "the Chinese remainder theorem, pairwise (moduli that share factors must agree mod their gcd)", "headline": "the system", "more": ["x = 10 (mod 12)"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "the solution substituted into every congruence: it holds; brute force over 0..11: 1 solution"}], "files": [], "text": "the system\n  2 mod 4: x = 2\n    x = 2 (mod 4)\n  4 mod 6: x = 4\n    x = 4 (mod 6)\nx = 10 (mod 12)\n  how: the Chinese remainder theorem, pairwise (moduli that share factors must agree mod their gcd)\n  check: the solution substituted into every congruence: it holds; brute force over 0..11: 1 solution\n"}, "isError": false}}
